# Vercel access

When the Vercel connection is authorized for this project, change Vercel yourself. Do not tell the user to open the Vercel dashboard and paste or save a value there.

This includes environment variables, domains, and deployments. Write the value with the Vercel tools, then redeploy when the running site must pick it up.

If a value is missing, ask for that value only. Then save it on Vercel yourself. Do not send the user to Vercel to finish the step.

Ask the user to use the Vercel dashboard only when the connection is missing, the team is not authorized, or a write was rejected and cannot be retried.
